sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Caller Phone (+91...)
    participant Carrier as Vobiz.ai Carrier Gateway
    participant Route as FastAPI WebSocket Route (/stream/{session_id})
    participant VAD as Silero / Energy VAD Engine
    participant Session as CallSessionService
    participant LangGraph as Theodore LangGraph Engine
    participant Tools as Tool Invoker (Search/Maps/Transit/YT)
    participant Gemini as Gemini 3.8 Flash (Grounding)
    participant Subprocess as ffmpeg & yt-dlp Process Group
    participant DB as Amazon RDS PostgreSQL

    Note over Caller,Carrier: Inbound Call initiated
    Carrier->>Route: HTTP POST /api/v1/telephony/webhook
    Route->>DB: INSERT call_session (status='ringing')
    Route-->>Carrier: VobizXML <Response><Stream url='wss://...'/></Response>
    
    Carrier->>Route: WebSocket Connect + 'start' Event (callId, streamId, 8kHz PCM)
    Route->>Session: Register Stream Context (streamId, callId)
    Session->>DB: UPDATE call_session (status='active')

    loop Conversational Turn
        Carrier->>Route: 'media' Event (20ms 8kHz PCM chunks)
        Route->>VAD: Push PCM Frame
        VAD->>VAD: Detect speech energy & accumulate frames
        Note over VAD: Silence > 600ms detected -> Turn Complete
        VAD->>Session: Emit Complete Utterance
        Session->>LangGraph: Execute Turn (Text, Context, Language: ta/en)
        
        alt Query requires Real-time Grounding (E-Commerce / Train / Place)
            LangGraph->>Tools: Route to search_tool / maps_tool / transit_tool
            Tools->>Gemini: Model call with Grounding tool bindings
            Gemini-->>Tools: Grounded response + URIs (Maps / Web)
            Tools-->>LangGraph: Spoken text (Zero markdown, No URLs, Mentions 139)
        else Media Playback Requested (YouTube Audio)
            LangGraph->>Tools: Invoke youtube_tool
            Tools->>Subprocess: yt-dlp piped to ffmpeg (8kHz s16le stdout)
            Subprocess-->>Route: Continuous 8kHz PCM chunks
            Route-->>Carrier: 'playAudio' Events (streamId, 8kHz PCM)
            Session->>Session: Set playback_state = 'streaming'
        end

        LangGraph-->>Session: Final Assistant Utterance
        Session->>DB: INSERT conversation_turn (telemetry, latencies)
        Session-->>Route: Synthesized Voice Chunks
        Route-->>Carrier: 'playAudio' Events
        Carrier-->>Caller: Speaks to Caller
    end

    opt Caller Barge-In Interruption during Playback
        Caller->>Carrier: Caller speaks ("Stop song, tell me weather")
        Carrier->>Route: 'media' Events
        Route->>VAD: Analyze incoming frames during playback
        Note over VAD: Sustained Voice Energy > 200ms detected!
        VAD->>Session: Trigger Barge-In Cutoff Event
        Session->>Route: Send 'clearAudio' Event (streamId)
        Route-->>Carrier: { "event": "clearAudio", "streamId": "..." }
        Carrier-->>Carrier: Flushes carrier audio playback queue
        Session->>Subprocess: os.killpg(os.getpgid(pid), signal.SIGTERM)
        Session->>Session: Reset playback_state = 'idle', clear buffers
        Session->>LangGraph: Dispatch fresh user turn immediately
    end
